    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i cant just \"be\" with it. being with it is the part that hurts. it feels like i'm just waiting for something to happen but nothing ever does. there's no way to change the walls or the silence. i'm just stuck in this loop and it feels like there's no actual exit. it's like i'm just waiting for the end of a movie i never wanted to watch.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
